        <body>
            <div xml:id="d297-a5">

                <pb facs="0671" n="623" sameAs="frus:frus1868p1/pg623"/>

                <head>Proclamation of the Tycoon.</head>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">To the Ohometzhes and the Ometzkes:</hi></p>
                <p>The imperial order was given on the 10th day of this month, (4th January,) to
                    communicate to the Daimios, the Hatamotos, and the Gosanke, the following
                    decree:</p>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Copy of the imperial order.</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#right">11<hi rendition="#small-caps">TH DAY OF</hi> 12<hi
                        rendition="#small-caps">TH MONTH</hi>.</p>
                <p>It has pleased the Mikado to dismiss the present Shogoon, at his request, from
                    the office of Shogoon,</p>
                <pb facs="0672" n="624" xml:id="pg624"/>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Copy of a proclamation of a Shakora
                        Iga No Kami to all officials, high and low.</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#right">12<hi rendition="#small-caps">th month.</hi></p>
                <p>As the title of Shogoon has been abolished, all subjects must use the title of
                    Uyesama.</p>
                <p>As the title of Midaisama has ceased to exist, the title of Goventsiasama must be
                    employed instead.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
